{"version":1,"content":"<p>越來越多的人形機械人正走進汽車製造工廠，最新加入這一趨勢的是沃爾沃。該公司正在比利時根特工廠訓練人形機械人，希望它們承擔部分重複性強、體力消耗大的工作。不過，機器進入職場的同時，也始終伴隨着取代人工的陰影。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588230.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.957192+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:20:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_hash":"907c57dbf9fbbca18606130425ec178b80ba17490880a7fb28c446621b1fbfcc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}